In article <1989Oct26.085839.26915@polyslo.CalPoly.EDU> cambler@polyslo.CalPoly.EDU (Fubar) writes:
>Now... on or around level 9, i killed a giant who had a mummy wrapping
>that i could wear as a cloak... What did it do for me? (no AC bonus...
>and it was +0)...

It keeps whatever is under it from rusting, and it has a 2/3 chance of
protecting you against certain monster special attacks such as bee stings.

Any other cloak does the same thing, with an almost 100% chance.  And most
other cloaks have better AC protection too.
